From a0eb11e4613cb98b28fdcdbf52410a7ee8ef6a97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 11:02:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add clickable coming-soon feature grid to Sales dashboard
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

